<%- include('../partials/header', { title: 'Privacy Policy | K-Sync Malaysia' }) %>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14 min-w-0 max-w-full">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Top Badge -->
    <div class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-pink-600 mb-3 transition-colors">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left me-1.5"></i> Back to K-Sync Malaysia
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
                <i class="fas fa-shield-halved me-1"></i> PDPA 2010 Compliance
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective Date: October 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            K-Sync Malaysia Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            K-Sync Malaysia is committed to protecting your personal data in accordance with the <strong>Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA 2010)</strong> of Malaysia. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and safeguard your information.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Articles -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Section 1: Information We Collect -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    1
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Information We Collect
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                We only collect data necessary to provide personalized event tracking, gamified concert passport badges, and community features:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2">
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Account Credentials:</strong> Full name, username, and email address. All user passwords are encrypted using salted one-way bcrypt hashing before storage.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Fan Preferences & Profile:</strong> Favorite K-Pop groups, bias members, profile avatars, and bio text.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Digital Passport & Event History:</strong> Records of events you have saved, attended, or checked-in to, along with unlocked fandom badges (e.g. Axiata Arena Veteran, Top Contributor).</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Organizer & Fanclub Records:</strong> Organization name, public contact email, and fanclub social channels submitted during event publishing.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Security & Anti-Scam Telemetry:</strong> Session cookies, IP address logs, and audit trails recorded strictly for spam prevention and scam investigation.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2: How We Use Your Data -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    2
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    How We Use Your Information
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Your personal data is used solely for the operational delivery of K-Sync Malaysia:
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
                    <div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <i class="fas fa-radar text-pink-500 me-1"></i> Event Radar & Personalization
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Matching upcoming concerts and cupsleeves with your favorited groups and nearest Malaysian city.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
                    <div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <i class="fas fa-passport text-purple-500 me-1"></i> Digital Passport & Badges
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Calculating your concert attendance history, stamping event badges, and tracking community loyalty milestones.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
                    <div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <i class="fas fa-bell text-amber-500 me-1"></i> Critical Event Notifications
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Alerting you if an event you saved has a schedule change, postponement, or venue update.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
                    <div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-virus text-rose-500 me-1"></i> Fraud & Scam Prevention
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Analyzing scam reports and protecting fan communities from ticket scalpers and fake listings.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Data Sharing & Non-Disclosure -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    3
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Data Sharing & Zero Sale Policy
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to any third-party advertisers or marketing brokers.
            </p>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-1.5">
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i class="fas fa-lock text-emerald-600"></i> Strict Privacy Standards:
                </div>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-600">
                    <li>No third-party cross-site advertising trackers or ad networks are deployed on K-Sync.</li>
                    <li>Data is only disclosed where required by Malaysian law enforcement or regulatory authorities in response to formal fraud or cybercrime investigations.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Data Security & Storage -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    4
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Security & Data Protection Measures
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                We implement industry-standard technical safeguards to protect your information:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2">
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Encryption in Transit & at Rest:</strong> All traffic is served over TLS/HTTPS encryption. Sensitive credentials utilize cryptographic hashing.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">HTTP-Only Session Cookies:</strong> Web authentication tokens are protected with SameSite and HTTP-only attributes to prevent cross-site scripting (XSS) extraction.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):</strong> Administrative oversight is restricted to verified personnel with automated audit logging for all actions.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Your Rights under PDPA 2010 -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-pink-50 text-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    5
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Your Rights under the Malaysian PDPA 2010
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Under the Malaysian Personal Data Protection Act 2010, you retain fundamental rights regarding your data:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2">
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Right to Access:</strong> You can view all personal details and event bookmarks directly within your <a href="/profile" class="text-pink-600 underline font-bold">Profile</a>.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Right to Rectification:</strong> You can edit your bio, fandom biases, avatar, and contact details at any time.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Right to Deletion:</strong> You may request the full deletion of your account and associated history by contacting support.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact & Feedback Box -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-base">Questions about your personal data?</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-0.5">Learn more about managing your profile or update your settings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
            <a href="/profile" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-all">
                My Profile
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
